  "description": "Fuselage: White forward/upper fuselage; standard Alaska midnight-blue sweep on the rear lower fuselage and belly with light-blue and lime-green bands. Cheatlines: Standard Alaska blue/green swooshes aft. Tail: Standard Alaska midnight-blue fin with the Alaska Native man and lime/teal stripe. Engines: White with the standard lime/blue swoosh low at the back. Winglets: Blue/green. Titles: Huge 'oneworld' (navy, 'one' bold) across the forward fuselage over the windows with small 'member of' above; 'Alaska' script in gray below it; small oneworld roundel near the nose. Artwork: none. Colors hex: approximate.",
